| H15 | **a TLS renegotiation** | NO CELL; a named limit (README Limits): whether a platform runs the validation callback again on a renegotiation is UNMEASURED |
| H16 | **HTTP authentication asked by a printer (401), Print-URI, priority print, Get-Printer-Attributes** | a 401 is refused like any other non-200 (N09); the rest is out of this lane (README Limits) |
